{"_comment":"§9 suffix rule fixtures: valid and invalid claim/lane suffixes per docs/ROOM-PROTOCOL.md. Grammar: /\\s*·\\s*claim:([0-9A-Za-z_-]+)\\s*·\\s*lane:([0-9A-Za-z_-]+)\\s*$/","invalid":[{"note":"Trailing content after lane — must be end of string","suffix":"· claim:RC-2026-09-17-002 · lane:quill-s2 · extra:foo"},{"note":"Space in claim ID — not in [0-9A-Za-z_-]","suffix":"· claim:RC 2026 · lane:quill-s2"},{"note":"Space in lane — not in [0-9A-Za-z_-]","suffix":"· claim:RC-2026 · lane:quill s2"},{"note":"Missing leading · separator","suffix":"claim:RC-2026 · lane:quill-s2"},{"note":"Missing lane: prefix","suffix":"· claim:RC-2026 · quill-s2"},{"note":"Wrong order — claim must come before lane","suffix":"· lane:quill-s2 · claim:RC-2026"},{"note":"Empty claim ID — + requires at least one char","suffix":"· claim: · lane:quill-s2"},{"note":"Empty string matches nothing","suffix":""}],"valid":[{"claim":"RC-2026-09-17-002","lane":"quill-s2","note":"Canonical example from protocol docs","suffix":"· claim:RC-2026-09-17-002 · lane:quill-s2"},{"claim":"5718257665","lane":"quill-s2","note":"Numeric claim ID (GitHub comment ID)","suffix":"· claim:5718257665 · lane:quill-s2"},{"claim":"abc_123","lane":"test-lane","note":"Extra whitespace tolerated by \\s*","suffix":"  ·  claim:abc_123  ·  lane:test-lane  "},{"claim":"XYZ","lane":"abc","note":"Minimal whitespace","suffix":"·claim:XYZ·lane:abc"}]}